<%- include('../partials/site-head', { seo }) %>
<%- include('../partials/site-header') %>
<main class="container marketingPage partnerCommissionPage">
  <section class="card heroCard marketingHero">
    <span class="badge badgeInfo"><i class="fa-solid fa-percent"></i> Transparent commission partnership</span>
    <h1 class="heroTitle">Grow your travel business with every completed booking.</h1>
    <p class="heroSub">Join Classic Trip as a verified bus operator, accommodation provider, flight agent or local mobility partner. There is no registration charge or expiring subscription: the configured commission applies only when a booking is successfully fulfilled.</p>
    <div class="metricRow heroMetricsRow">
      <div class="stat"><b><%= platformConfig.partnerCommissionPercent %>%</b><span>Classic Trip commission</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b><%= platformConfig.partnerPayoutPercent %>%</b><span>Partner share</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>Free</b><span>Partner registration</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>No expiry</b><span>Verified partner account</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="actions heroActionsRow">
      <a class="btn btnPrimary" href="/login?role=partner#partner"><i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i> Become a verified partner</a>
      <a class="btn btnGhost" href="/how-it-works"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> See how it works</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section detailGrid">
    <article class="card" style="padding:14px">
      <div class="sectionHead">
        <div><h2>How each booking is shared</h2><p>The commercial terms are recorded with the booking for transparent reconciliation.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="routeList">
        <div class="routeItem"><div><strong>Customer pays</strong><div class="small">The confirmed booking total shown at checkout.</div></div><span class="badge badgeInfo">100%</span></div>
        <div class="routeItem"><div><strong>Partner receives</strong><div class="small">Your configured share becomes payable after fulfilment and settlement checks.</div></div><span class="badge badgeOk"><%= platformConfig.partnerPayoutPercent %>%</span></div>
        <div class="routeItem"><div><strong>Classic Trip retains</strong><div class="small">Funds marketplace operations, secure payment processing and customer support.</div></div><span class="badge badgeWarn"><%= platformConfig.partnerCommissionPercent %>%</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="notice" style="margin-top:12px">When an eligible promoter referred the booking, the promoter reward comes from Classic Trip’s commission. It is not deducted again from the customer or partner share.</div>
    </article>

    <article class="card" style="padding:14px">
      <div class="sectionHead">
        <div><h2>What verified partners receive</h2><p>Each service type gets the tools and permissions appropriate to its real operating model.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="routeList">
        <div class="routeItem"><div><strong>Bus and accommodation operations</strong><div class="small">Manage approved listings, schedules or room inventory, bookings, staff and fulfilment.</div></div><i class="fa-solid fa-bus-simple"></i></div>
        <div class="routeItem"><div><strong>Flight-agent workspace</strong><div class="small">Search approved supplier inventory, prepare quotes, book travellers and support issued tickets.</div></div><i class="fa-solid fa-plane"></i></div>
        <div class="routeItem"><div><strong>Safe local mobility work</strong><div class="small">Verified riders, drivers and fleet owners manage availability, assigned rides and earnings.</div></div><i class="fa-solid fa-taxi"></i></div>
        <div class="routeItem"><div><strong>Finance and support</strong><div class="small">Track settlements, payouts, refunds, disputes, reports and auditable activity.</div></div><i class="fa-solid fa-wallet"></i></div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="sectionHead"><div><h2>A partnership built for East Africa</h2><p>Professional onboarding, clear responsibilities and country-aware settlement information.</p></div></div>
    <div class="routeCardGrid">
      <article class="card routeCard" style="padding:14px"><span class="badge badgeInfo"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield"></i> Verification</span><h3>Build customer trust</h3><p class="muted">Business, agency, driver, vehicle and payout details are reviewed according to the selected service type.</p></article>
      <article class="card routeCard" style="padding:14px"><span class="badge badgeOk"><i class="fa-solid fa-coins"></i> Local settlement</span><h3>Use the right currency</h3><p class="muted">Country-aware onboarding links each supported market to its correct operating currency and timezone.</p></article>
      <article class="card routeCard" style="padding:14px"><span class="badge badgeWarn"><i class="fa-solid fa-headset"></i> Operations</span><h3>Get platform support</h3><p class="muted">Booking, payment, cancellation, dispute and settlement records stay connected from sale to fulfilment.</p></article>
      <article class="card routeCard" style="padding:14px"><span class="badge badgeHot"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i> Growth</span><h3>Reach more travellers</h3><p class="muted">Publish verified services in one marketplace and use accurate availability to convert searches into bookings.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card marketingCtaCard" style="padding:14px">
    <div class="sectionHead marketingCtaHead">
      <div><h2>Ready to join Classic Trip?</h2><p>Select your service during signup and the form will request only the relevant business, agency, rider, driver or fleet information.</p></div>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btnPrimary" href="/login?role=partner#partner"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i> Start partner registration</a>
        <a class="btn btnGhost" href="/support"><i class="fa-solid fa-headset"></i> Contact support</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/site-footer') %>
